WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.042
1. Go to Team. Each person shows what's overdue, coming up, on their turn and waiting on others.

2
00:00:03.042 --> 00:00:05.718
2. Choose how far ahead to look: 30, 60, 90 or 180 days.

3
00:00:05.718 --> 00:00:09.290
3. Click a person to see each contract, how long it has waited and its supplier and value.

4
00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:14.250
4. Click a contract to open it.
